**************************************************************************
* NVLS (NVLink SHARP) DISABLED for NCCL -- falling back to NVLink P2P     *
**************************************************************************
* The GPU advertises multicast support, but the NVLink fabric/IMEX plane *
* is NOT provisioned on this node, so NVLS multicast memory cannot be    *
* bound. Collectives will still work over NVLink P2P, but NVLS-           *
* accelerated NCCL is off and performance may be reduced. (Single-node   *
* NVLS over POSIX-FD, e.g. MNNVL allreduce, is unaffected.)              *
*                                                                        *
* To enable NVLS: start nvidia-imex and expose                           *
* /dev/nvidia-caps-imex-channels to the container. Set                   *
* NCCL_NVLS_ENABLE=1 explicitly to override this fallback.               *
**************************************************************************
